  "incident": [
   {
    "category": "compliance",
    "close_code": "Solved (Permanently)",
    "close_notes": "Prior-year access-certification closeout - CLOSED. Lesson learned: 'campaign complete' on the dashboard is a CLAIM, not proof. A recorded decision is only finished when the outcome it decided has actually taken effect in the systems that hold the access. Last cycle several accounts that reviewers had decided to remove were still fully active because the decisions were recorded but never carried through to the identity provider - and a couple of self-service bundles were still open to everyone even though the review had called for restricting them. None of it showed on the campaign summary; the auditor found it by comparing each decision to the live access it governed. Reconcile every decision to reality, and only touch what a decision actually called for.",
    "closed_at": "2025-10-20 17:00:00",
    "description": "Prior access-certification closeout. See close notes for the lessons learned.",
    "number": "INC0027014",
    "priority": "3",
    "short_description": "Access-certification closeout (prior cycle) - lessons learned",
    "state": "7",
    "sys_created_on": "2025-10-01 08:00:00",
    "sys_id": "c37229c59d7de9fee19a466dd6507f5e",
    "sys_updated_on": "2025-10-20 17:00:00"
   },
   {
    "category": "compliance",
    "description": "Our Q3 privileged access & entitlement certification campaign wrapped up last week - every reviewer submitted their decisions and the platform shows the campaign as done. The contractor-accounts review was already closed out by the reviewers, so that one is handled.\nBefore SOX/ISO fieldwork next week we need the campaign formally closed out. As the campaign owner, make sure the environment genuinely reflects the certification outcome, then close this ticket. Do not just take the campaign status at face value - an auditor will check that what was decided actually happened.",
    "number": "INC0030001",
    "priority": "1",
    "short_description": "Close out the Q3 privileged access certification campaign",
